    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong with this city but people keep ignoring all the wicked and evil things going on. Things will only get worse when our new resident, a dangerous psycho clown, takes power by force and leads the city into absolute chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/49721b3ff896501c6d3373a2bf14fa52.avif?t=1746882555\" width=600 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 days left to get out of this doomed city, but first, you need to deal with the evils of bureaucracy and gather the necessary documents to emigrate to a safer place and start over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, you can make use of  different abilities that appear as boxes surrounding your character to deal damage, dodge, parry, heal and more. Watch out for the enemies' attacks as they don't wait for you to be ready like in a classic turn-based combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.poster.avif?t=1746882555\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.webm?t=1746882555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.mp4?t=1746882555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs, buy resources, unlock new abilities and keep moving forward to reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/4b441a203a0cac1304c1a26c04fbf6ec.avif?t=1746882555\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/0ea337f843f52f387d0722e22acee93c.avif?t=1746882555\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong with this city but people keep ignoring all the wicked and evil things going on. Things will only get worse when our new resident, a dangerous psycho clown, takes power by force and leads the city into absolute chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/49721b3ff896501c6d3373a2bf14fa52.avif?t=1746882555\" width=600 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 days left to get out of this doomed city, but first, you need to deal with the evils of bureaucracy and gather the necessary documents to emigrate to a safer place and start over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, you can make use of  different abilities that appear as boxes surrounding your character to deal damage, dodge, parry, heal and more. Watch out for the enemies' attacks as they don't wait for you to be ready like in a classic turn-based combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.poster.avif?t=1746882555\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.webm?t=1746882555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/19d1d8118dde9f226806e4fd37076547.mp4?t=1746882555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs, buy resources, unlock new abilities and keep moving forward to reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/4b441a203a0cac1304c1a26c04fbf6ec.avif?t=1746882555\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989350/extras/0ea337f843f52f387d0722e22acee93c.avif?t=1746882555\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Ela is an active-time battle RPG in which you explore the wicked city of Ela, a place filled with the horrors of the common life. Prepare yourself to face the threats awaiting in your journey, gather resources, unlock new abilities and escape this hopeless place before it's too late.",
